  "content": "<p>修改掉落物品和方块的外观。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftranslate.soundsofthesun.net%252fprojects%252fitem-drops%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://translate.soundsofthesun.net/widget/item-drops/status-badge.png\" alt=\"翻譯狀態\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/FvCNWcm8/images/a715055c508afdbfa2f1fcc63434113be51bbdde.webp\" alt=\"示範圖\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/FvCNWcm8/images/faac8cb2dc73b61f25c860cfe45d70a3b3117fcd.webp\" alt=\"設定選項圖\"></p>\n<h3>問題</h3>\n<p>You can submit issues on <a href=\"https://github.com/SoundsoftheSun/item-drops/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github</a> or <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcodeberg.org%252fSoundsoftheSun%252fItem-Drops%252fissues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Codeberg</a></p>\n<h3>翻譯</h3>\n<p>Most of my downloads come from countries where English is not the primary language! If you want to help translate any of my mods to your language, you can go to <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftranslate.soundsofthesun.net%252fprojects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://translate.soundsofthesun.net/projects</a> and sign in with github to contribute!</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftranslate.soundsofthesun.net%252fprojects%252fitem-drops%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://translate.soundsofthesun.net/widget/item-drops/multi-auto.svg\" alt=\"Translation status\"></a></p>\n<p>Translation Credits:</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>語言</th>\n<th>貢獻者</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Simplified Chinese</td>\n<td>LinLei_Baruch &amp; NRHSYD</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Arabic</td>\n<td>Amir</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>More translation history can be found on the i18n branch of the source repository.</p>",
